{"id":"81608826d1fc98bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-universal-measurable.md","title":"Universally Measurable Set","display":"df-universal-measurable — Universally Measurable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-universal-measurable","aliases":["58-df-universal-measurable"],"display":"df-universal-measurable — Universally Measurable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-universal-measurable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-universal-measurable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-measurable — Universally Measurable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbddaeec1a020d3b\" href=\"?note=bbddaeec1a020d3b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md\">../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"990e93a33f4633db\" href=\"?note=990e93a33f4633db\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-null-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq X\">\\(A \\subseteq X\\)</span> (候选可测集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-null Borel sets, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\\)</span> (Borel-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbddaeec1a020d3b\" href=\"?note=bbddaeec1a020d3b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md\">../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (普遍可测谓词, 本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}null\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash \\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{N\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\;(N\\subseteq B\\land\\mu(B)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}null\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash \\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{N\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\;(N\\subseteq B\\land\\mu(B)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\sigma_X(\\tau))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\mu\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\sigma_X(\\tau))\\to A\\in\\sigma_X(\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\cup\\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\sigma_X(\\tau))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\mu\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\sigma_X(\\tau))\\to A\\in\\sigma_X(\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\cup\\mathcal N_\\mu(X,\\tau))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathcal U(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathcal U(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\operatorname{UniversallyMeasurable}(A,X,\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbddaeec1a020d3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"990e93a33f4633db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",